    <item>
      <title>HELLO CLIPY 1.3.2</title>
      <pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 06:15:02 +0900</pubDate>
      <link>https://github.com/KDOJP/HelloClipy-Updates/releases/tag/v1.3.2</link>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <p>Adds full CloudKit history reconciliation and automatically repairs records missing from individual Macs.</p>
        <p>Keeps menu-open synchronization fast with incremental updates, while periodic full audits detect count and record-ID differences.</p>
        <p>Synchronizes history deletions safely and shows incremental-sync and full-audit status separately in the menu.</p>
      ]]></description>
