    <item>
      <title>HELLO CLIPY 1.3.1</title>
      <pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 02:13:01 +0900</pubDate>
      <link>https://github.com/KDOJP/HelloClipy-Updates/releases/tag/v1.3.1</link>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <p>Sets the default clipboard history limit to 100 and prevents zero or invalid limits from deleting saved history.</p>
        <p>Synchronizes the history limit and reorder-after-paste setting between Macs signed in to the same iCloud account.</p>
        <p>Includes CloudKit synchronization reliability and HELLO CLIPY test-suite fixes.</p>
      ]]></description>
